{"hw":"Κέως","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">Κέως</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Κέως</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ceos</cite>, one of the Cyclades, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12(5).532.7</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Str.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.5.6</span> </span>, etc.:—hence <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Κεῖος</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Κήϊος</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, a <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ceian</cite>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.102</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">οὐ Χῖος, ἀλλὰ Κεῖος</span> not a (roguish) Chian, but an (honest) <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ceian</cite>, proverb in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">970</span> </span>; <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀκόλαστόν τινα.., καὶ οὐδαμῶς Κεῖον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">341e</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">638b</span> </span>; prov., <span class=\"gk\">ἐν Κέῳ τίς ἡμέρα</span>; <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Crates Com.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">29.5</span> </span>. (Not to be confused with <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Κέος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">42(1).122.117</span> </span>, or with <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">Κέος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.76</span> </span> (cf. <b class=\"lex-tr\">Wiener Sitzb.</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">211(1).30</span> </span>).)</div></div>"}